# GitHub synchronization

- The canonical remote is `https://github.com/nowly56/telegram-openai-bot.git` on `main`.
- When making project changes, verify them, commit the intended files, and push to `origin/main`.
- Never commit `.env`, API keys, bot tokens, `data/`, or anything under `sources/`.
- Never force-push. If authentication, network access, or a merge conflict blocks the push, report it clearly.
